# The travel-time table is binary; never let line-ending conversion touch it.
*.tt binary
# So is the crust model.
*.bin binary
# The SP12RTS model files are kept byte-identical to the authors' download (see the checksums in
# assets/sp12rts/README.md).
*.sph -text
# Windows batch files need CRLF line endings for cmd.exe to read labels reliably.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
